. *============================================================================
> ==
. * HEADLINE: hub-quality connectivity -> trade openness, IV = leave-out market
>  access
. *   outcome    = trade_intensity = ln(trade/GDP) = openness
. *   treatment  = ln_gaci_cwm (capacity-weighted-mean GACI; size-neutral hub Q
> UALITY)
. *   instrument = lnz (leave-out Frankel-Romer market access; FOREIGN pop / di
> st^2)
. *   FE         = region + year  (absorb regcode y) -- country FE kills this g
> eographic IV
. *   first-stage F printed via 'first'; SE clustered by country.
. *============================================================================
> ==
. di _n "==== M1 HEADLINE: trade_intensity (ln_gaci_cwm = lnz), absorb(regcode 
> y) ===="

==== M1 HEADLINE: trade_intensity (ln_gaci_cwm = lnz), absorb(regcode y) ====

